{"step_index":1553,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:00:56Z","thinking":"Identified a perfect match for the company `(주)브이알코리아` in the dataset, confirming the final modification date as October 2012. Extracted key details including the representative, address, registration number, and KOBIS code. The URL provides further verification of this company's information using the KOBIS code.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Search for VR Korea Park Hak-mun business number","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"const https = require('https');\n\nfunction searchDaum(q) {\n  return new Promise(resolve => {\n    https.get('https://search.daum.net/search?w=tot&q=' + encodeURIComponent(q), {\n      headers: { 'User-Agent': 'Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36' }\n    }, res => {\n      let d = '';\n      res.on('data', c => d += c);\n      res.on('end', () => {\n        const m = d.match(/\\b\\d{3}-\\d{2}-\\d{5}\\b/g) || [];\n        console.log(`[Daum] \"${q}\" biz matches:`, [...new Set(m)]);\n        const snips = d.match(/.{0,40}브이알코리아.{0,60}/g) || [];\n        snips.slice(0, 3).forEach(s => console.log(' - ' + s.replace(/<[^>]+>/g, ' ')));\n        resolve();\n      });\n    }).on('error', () => resolve());\n  });\n}\n\nasync function run() {\n  await searchDaum('브이알코리아 박학문');\n  await searchDaum('주식회사 브이알코리아 부산');\n}\n\nrun();\n","Description":"Search Daum for VR Korea","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\22cde527-6a05-4644-ad41-9385bbc0ffd2\\scratch\\search_vrkorea.js","toolAction":"Create search_vrkorea.js","toolSummary":"Create search_vrkorea.js"}}]}
